  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Organisation and Logistical Support for &apos;&apos;Brussels VII Conference on the future of Syria and the Region&apos;&apos; 14-15 June 2023, VO Communication SA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: Organisation and Logistical Support for &apos;&apos;Brussels VII Conference on the future of Syria and the Region&apos;&apos; 14-15 June 2023, VO Communication SA - The Multi-annual work programme in favour of the Syria crisis response for 2022-2023 is a support measure giving the European Commission the possibility to finance measures and activities that are needed for the achievement of the Union&#xbf;s political and financial commitment to support the Syrian people and countries in Syria&#xbf;s neighbourhood affected by the crisis. The support measure will finance administrative, technical and logistical support associated with the preparation, consultation, coordination, follow-up, communication and other activities necessary for the successful organisation of the Brussels conferences and related processes.&amp;nbsp;</narrative>
  </description>
